      "bbox": [
        141,
        952,
        1082,
        1139
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "VIII. A change in the amount of union dues shall only be effective on the first payroll subsequent to January 1, or July 1, following the date on which notice of such change is furnished as provided in paragraph IX. Requests for dues rate changes shall be filed not less than two months before such effective date. However, subject to the approval of the Comptroller, employee organizations may request during other periods of the year changes of dues rates to be effected not less than two months after such request is filed.",
